{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_514_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_514_rs_01_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "774370e42a4f12f0e319f9c2e7fc9fc271a0d0f64d69caa8c5b798161d175f35", "ja": "ほら、明日から秋葉原でお仕事でしょ？\nそれで電話したの。", "zh": "你看，明天开始要在秋叶原工作吧？\n所以我才打电话给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_514_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_514_rs_01_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "d02c2925c36bdce9f425c4cb102c207f02a8b49793060916430bce5dac2e8753", "ja": "お店とのコラボとか、いっぱいあるんだよね？\nアタシ、めっちゃ楽しみでさ～！", "zh": "和店铺合作之类的活动有很多，对吧？\n我可是超级期待的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_514_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_514_rs_01_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "09349ad0094f8e95dbc668b739a76fdbb226e5e9641aedb8bf2f623ea49b3be2", "ja": "だって、コラボドリンクとか絶対楽しくない？\nグッズ買ったら特典もらえるのも、超うれしいし！", "zh": "因为联名饮料之类的活动肯定很有意思吧？\n买周边还能拿到特典，真的超开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_514_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_514_rs_01_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "171197257d8d3f33c07b6cad74cd0400e7450ed5e41043125313c80938ea462f", "ja": "あ、アタシ、店内放送もするんだよね？\nにゃはは、どんな感じになるんだろ～。", "zh": "啊，我还要负责店内广播对吧？\n呀哈哈，到时候会是什么感觉呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_514_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_514_rs_01_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "ddcc2e45b0863b0ce0825145fc71847dba7aa91ebe857a1377b47dff2f8c0525", "ja": "わ、想像したら、なんかもうドキドキしてきた！\n……って、これじゃアタシが楽しんでるな？", "zh": "哇，想象一下就让我开始心跳加速了！\n……等等，这样不就变成我自己在享受了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_514_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_514_rs_01_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "a82470cc153478641da9885a85962e10ffd76ba2efde6211255f22d32407af56", "ja": "うん、みんなに目いっぱい楽しんでもらえるように、\nアタシはしっかり案内しなきゃだよね！　がんばる！", "zh": "嗯，为了能让大家尽情玩个痛快，\n我可得好好给她们带路才行呢！我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_514_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_514_rs_01_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "48f2827dbd943137464efb6ab54658baf8d8758da008d35c992d3b0afa090e2e", "ja": "そんで、仕事が終わったら近場のファミレスで、\nみんなで打ち上げすんの！　いいでしょ？", "zh": "然后工作结束后，大家一起去附近的家庭餐厅庆祝收工！很棒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
